        "Maintenance is available as ongoing service or a one-time job — mowing, hedge and tree trimming, weed and pest control, fertilisation, and seasonal replanting for households that want the garden looked after rather than doing it themselves between our visits. What's not included: tree removal requiring municipality permits for protected or large mature trees — we'll tell you if a permit applies before doing the work.",
